  "has_voiceover": false,
  "description": "Adding to 2 Winning Stocks and 2 New Stocks",
  "body_html": "<p>It’s been a brutal few months in the market. Day traders getting flung around. Iran War…Strait Of Hormuz…Tariffs…Yen Carry Trade… Foreign Market Collapses…<em><strong>so much negative news</strong></em>. And through all of that, I have maintained that we remain in a bull market, but to wait for breakouts to occur. </p><p>And today, the S&amp;P 500 hit all time highs. The DOW, is also breaking out. </p><p>Trend is friend, we let our winners compound and throw money at the market when it is working for us. </p><p>Watch the video, I elaborate on current winning stocks that I am adding to and two new stocks that are showing incredible strength. </p><p>I do think that most stocks, the broader market, will go up. But we want to target what has the most momentum. What is most likely to have the highest percent returns. As always, if you have questions about any of these, swing by the <em><strong><a href=\"https://open.substack.com/chat/posts/f0cce345-4d01-43b4-87c8-60102042ebb8\">Main Chat</a>,</strong></em> during market hours, and I will be happy to explain more. </p><h4>The stocks are…</h4>",
  "has_dynamic_content": false,
  "truncated_body_text": "It’s been a brutal few months in the market. Day traders getting flung around. Iran War…Strait Of Hormuz…Tariffs…Yen Carry Trade… Foreign Market Collapses…so much negative news. And through all of that, I have maintained that we remain in a bull market, but to wait for breakouts to occur.",
